[02:04.29] I'm running out of time
[02:08.76] I'm out of step and closing down
[02:13.92] And never sleep for wanting hours
[02:18.43] The empty hours of greed
[02:23.85] And uselessly always the need
[02:29.10] To feel again the real belief
[02:34.31] Of something more than mockery
[02:39.24] If only I could fill my heart with love.
